><div><b>&#10;</b></div><div><b>Role Overview &#8211; </b>Avionics Engineer We are seeking highly motivated and technically strong graduates to join our Avionics team. You will work on end-to-end development of flight-critical electronic systems, embedded software, and electrical integration that power our space launch vehicles. This role provides an exceptional opportunity to apply your electronics and software expertise to real-world aerospace applications in a fast-paced, innovation-driven environment.&#160;</div><div><b>Roles and Responsibilities&#10;</b></div><div>Contribute to the design and development of embedded systems, electronics hardware, and software for flight and ground systems.&#10;</div><div>Work on hardware design, PCB development, firmware programming, and system testing.&#10;</div><div>Support integration and validation of avionics systems including sensors, controllers, and power distribution.&#10;</div><div>Participate in data acquisition, telemetry, and control system development for launch vehicles.&#10;</div><div>Collaborate across teams (mechanical, propulsion, systems) to ensure seamless system-level performance.&#10;</div><div>Ensure compliance with aerospace quality, safety, and reliability standards.&#10;</div><div><b>&#160; Must-Have Qualifications&#10;</b></div><div>B.Tech / B.E. (Final Year or Recent Graduate)  in Electronics and Communication, Electrical, or Instrumentation Engineering.&#10;</div><div>Strong fundamentals in electronics, control systems, embedded systems, and circuit design.&#10;</div><div>Proficiency in C/C++ or Python, and exposure to microcontrollers, FPGAs, or embedded platforms.&#10;</div><div>Knowledge of electrical schematics, PCB tools, or simulation software (MATLAB, LTSpice, etc.).&#10;</div><div>Strong analytical, problem-solving, and debugging skills.&#10;</div><div>Excellent teamwork, communication, and a passion for technology and aerospace innovation.&#10;</div><div><b>Why Join Skyroot Aerospace?&#10;</b></div><div>Work on cutting-edge avionics that power India&#8217;s private space missions.&#10;</div><div>Collaborate with experienced engineers, scientists, and ISRO alumni.&#10;</div><div>Opportunity to see your designs and code literally take flight.&#10;</div><div>A learning-driven, collaborative culture focused on engineering excellence and innovation.&#10;</div><div><b>&#160;Location: </b>Hyderabad, Telangana&#10;</div><div><b>Employment Type:</b> Full-time</div>","additional_details":null,"is_notification_muted":false,"is_withdrawal_same_as_application_deadline":false,"is_new_company":false,"is_display_name_same_as_company_name":true,"is_included_in_application_matrix":false,"display_name":"Skyroot Aerospace Private Limited","is_published":true,"is_deleted":false,"is_process_completed":false,"created_by":9578,"created_by_name":"Admin","updated_by":9578,"created_at":1763785682000,"updated_at":1764308131000,"company_query":{"overview":null,"city":null,"state":null,"zip":null,"pan":null,"contacts":null,"sourceHistory":null,"placecoms":null,"approved":false,"company_id":1237,"company_name":"Skyroot Aerospace Private Limited","source":"Existing Database","website_url":null,"logo":null,"industry":null,"address_line_1":null,"address_line_2":null,"is_approved":false,"is_disabled":false,"primary_placecoms":null,"secondary_placecoms":null,"created_by":8525,"updated_by":9939,"created_at":1763464503000,"updated_at":1769749545000},"questions":[],"documents":[{"documentName":null,"jd_document_id":844,"application_id":789,"document_id":14322,"user_id":9578,"document_type_id":5,"uuid":"0d119c24-bc20-4d9a-9dac-6ec351e666d9","file_name":"Electrical & electronics","file_original_name":"Mechanical Aerospace  Industrial Engineering_Update  - JD.docx","file_extension":"docx","file_path":"/datadrive/iisc-files/skynet-v2-files/9578-9578","file_size":"18 KB","file_name_in_path":"1763785654387_MechanicalAerospaceIndustrialEngineering_Update-JD.docx","file_link":"9578-9578/176378565